# Terramate Configuration Standards

## Stack Definition Pattern
Every stack directory must contain a `stack.tm.hcl` file:
```hcl
stack {
  name        = "{{STACK_NAME_EXAMPLE}}"
  description = "{{STACK_DESCRIPTION_EXAMPLE}}"
  id          = "{{STACK_ID_EXAMPLE}}"  # Unique slug or UUID

  # Explicit ordering (use instead of implicit path ordering)
  after = [
    "{{DEPENDENCY_STACK_PATH}}",
  ]
}
```

## Globals Pattern (`globals.tm.hcl`)
Share values across stacks using globals:
```hcl
globals {
  environment = "{{ENVIRONMENT}}"
  location    = "{{LOCATION}}"
  prefix      = "{{PREFIX}}"

  module_versions = {
    "{{MODULE_NAME}}" = "{{MODULE_VERSION}}"
  }
}
```

