## generate_hcl Rules
- Generated files are prefixed with `_generated_` and committed to the repo
- Run `terramate generate` after any change to `generate_hcl` blocks
- Never hand-edit generated `_generated_*.tf` files — changes will be overwritten
- Use `assert` blocks in `generate_hcl` to validate required globals are set
